            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.14 — Sign in with Google</h3>
<ul>
<li>"Continue with Google", "Sign in with Apple" and other sign-in buttons now work: they open in a small window that hands your login back to the site and closes itself.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
