            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.13 — Tidier reading</h3>
<ul>
<li>Reader view now leaves out Wikipedia's info tables, notes and [1]-style citation marks, so it's just the article.</li>
<li>The recent-tabs switcher (⌃Tab) fades softly at its ends when you have more tabs than fit.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
