            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.12 — Clearer answers</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ask now answers the way Dia does: the answer first, then a few short points with bold labels, using the page's own names, numbers and dates.</li>
<li>Bigger, easier-to-read text in the Ask panel, with more room to breathe.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
